      <p begin="02:54.720" end="02:57.550" ttm:agent="v1">Try and pull that, got me acting shady</p>
      <p begin="02:57.550" end="02:59.920" ttm:agent="v1">What's that supposed to be about, baby?</p>
      <p begin="02:59.920" end="03:02.560" ttm:agent="v1">Go free up your vibe, stop acting crazy</p>
      <p begin="03:02.560" end="03:05.210" ttm:agent="v1">You know I give you the good loving daily</p>
      <p begin="03:05.210" end="03:07.750" ttm:agent="v1">Try and pull that, got me actin' shady</p>
      <p begin="03:07.750" end="03:11.120" ttm:agent="v1">Oh-oh-oh-oh</p>
      <p begin="03:11.120" end="03:13.090" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, we need to let it breathe</p>
      <p begin="03:13.090" end="03:16.800" ttm:agent="v1">Oh-oh-oh-oh</p>
      <p begin="03:16.800" end="03:19.270" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, we need to let it breathe</p>
      <p begin="03:19.270" end="03:27.270" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="03:28.830" end="03:31.930" ttm:agent="v1">You say that you love me, that you love me</p>
